From: Gilly <gilroyscott1970@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 May 2026 13:30:00 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] net: pcs: airoha: extend E2 RX calibration and recovery

The AN7581 PCS driver skips manual RX calibration for SoC revisions
>= E2, on the assumption that E2+ silicon autocalibrates correctly.
In practice E2 silicon (PRODUCT_ID = 2) on Gemtek W1700K HW.1.1
boards leaves RX permanently stuck on ~80% of cold boots when manual
calibration is skipped, while HW.1.0 (PRODUCT_ID = 1) is reliable.

The manual calibration path retries up to AIROHA_PCS_MAX_CALIBRATION_TRY
times when the FreqDet module fails to lock; the autocalibration path
has no equivalent retry. Extend the threshold to include E2 silicon.

XR1710G routes its 10G LAN port through the PON PCS instance. The SDK
applies the same RX calibration and CDR recovery sequence to either
external SerDes, but Linux only enabled both mechanisms for the ETH PCS.
Apply E2 manual calibration to both ETH and PON PCS instances and enable
the existing signal-detect/CDR recovery callback for PON as well.

Signed-off-by: Gilly <gilroyscott1970@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: Codex:GPT-5.6-sol
Signed-off-by: Yanghan Ye <yyh94306@gmail.com>
--- a/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha-common.c
+++ b/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha-common.c
@@ -1454,18 +1454,19 @@ static int airoha_pcs_probe(struct platf
 	if (IS_ERR(priv->xfi_rst))
 		return dev_err_probe(dev, PTR_ERR(priv->xfi_rst), "failed to get xfi reset lines\n");
 
-	/* For Ethernet PCS, read the AN7581 SoC revision to check if
-	 * manual rx calibration is needed. This is only limited to
-	 * any SoC revision before E2.
+	/* For the external Ethernet SerDes, read the AN7581 SoC revision to
+	 * check if manual RX calibration is needed. Extend the threshold to
+	 * include E2 silicon.
 	 */
-	if (device_is_compatible(dev, "airoha,an7581-pcs-eth")) {
+	if (device_is_compatible(dev, "airoha,an7581-pcs-eth") ||
+	    device_is_compatible(dev, "airoha,an7581-pcs-pon")) {
 		u32 val;
 
 		ret = regmap_read(priv->scu, AIROHA_SCU_PDIDR, &val);
 		if (ret)
 			return ret;
 
-		if (FIELD_GET(AIROHA_SCU_PRODUCT_ID, val) < 0x2)
+		if (FIELD_GET(AIROHA_SCU_PRODUCT_ID, val) < 0x3)
 			priv->manual_rx_calib = true;
 	}
 
@@ -1539,6 +1540,7 @@ static const struct airoha_pcs_match_dat
 	.usxgmii_ber_time_fixup = true,
 	.alloc_regmap_fields = an7581_pcs_alloc_regmap_fields,
 	.bringup = an7581_pcs_bringup,
+	.rxlock_workaround = an7581_pcs_rxlock_workaround,
 };
 
 static const struct airoha_pcs_match_data an7581_pcs_pcie = {
--- a/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-an7581.c
+++ b/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-an7581.c
@@ -1872,8 +1872,8 @@ retry_calibration:
 
 	an7581_pcs_cdr_reset(priv, index, interface, false);
 
-	/* Manual RX calibration is required only for SoC before E2
-	 * revision. E2+ SoC autocalibrate RX and only CDR reset is needed.
+	/* Manual RX calibration is required for SoC revisions through E2.
+	 * E3+ SoCs autocalibrate RX and only CDR reset is needed.
 	 */
 	if (!priv->manual_rx_calib)
 		return 0;
